&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;Property,&amp;#160;Plant&amp;#160;and Equipment accruals were&amp;#160;insignificant&amp;#160;as of December 31,&amp;#160;2025&amp;#160;and December 31,&amp;#160;2024&amp;#160;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;Amortization expense of intangible assets totaled $0.8 million in 2025 and $2.1 million in 2024. Estimated amortization expense is $0.2 million for 2026, $0.17 million for&amp;#160;2027,&amp;#160; 0.12&amp;#160;million for 2028, and insignificant for 2029 and 2030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were 1.67% for 2025&amp;#160;and 1.74% for 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was $0.07&amp;#160;million in 2025&amp;#160;(an equity&amp;#160;component&amp;#160;of $0.04&amp;#160;million and an interest expense&amp;#160;component&amp;#160;of 0.03) and&amp;#160;was $0.2&amp;#160;million in 2024 (an equity&amp;#160;component&amp;#160;of $0.08&amp;#160;million and an interest expense&amp;#160;component&amp;#160;of&amp;#160;$0.04&amp;#160;million).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
