      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <p>Gulfstream estimates that the Deferred Income Tax Adjustment Gross-Up would not be included in the development of jurisdictional rates.&#160;</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
